OL,3,GNEWSAA3 horse rescue was 'frightening
OL,4,Afor everyone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who helped to catch a horse which
OL,7,Fbolted on to the A3 says the experience
OL,8,Fwas "frightening for everyone", but is
OL,9,Fglad that the animal was recovered
OL,10,Fsafely.
OL,12,FPeter Bound, a telehandler driver for
OL,13,Fthe Environment Agency, was driving
OL,14,Falong the road near Wisley, Surrey, on
OL,15,FTuesday when he spotted the escaped
OL,16,Fhorse on a verge by the side of the
OL,17,Froad, before it moved into the
OL,18,Fcarriageway.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
