OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA3 horse rescue was 'frightening
OL,4,Afor everyone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBound, along with other passers-by,
OL,7,Fhelped to slow traffic so he could
OL,8,Fapproach the horse and bring it to the
OL,9,Fside of the road, where it was looked
OL,10,Fafter until police officers arrived.
OL,12,FHe told BBC Radio Surrey: "You never
OL,13,Fknow what animals are going to do, but
OL,14,Fyou have to speak to them calmly."
